    :hasEvidenceText "Data-free quantization is similar to data-free knowledge distillation but is a more complex problem because quantization errors must be recovered."^^xsd:string,
        "Post-training quantization aims to reduce the computation cost of matrix multiplication by converting X and W to xed-point quantized values"^^xsd:string,
        "difference between the exact versus the discretized computation"^^xsd:string,
        "formulate the quantization error difference between X and X + N for a quantizer Q"^^xsd:string,
        "get small quantization errors for both weights and activations"^^xsd:string,
        "large output error"^^xsd:string,
        "strong control on the difference between the exact versus the discretized computation."^^xsd:string,
        "the trade-off between between clipping and rounding error described in section 2.2"^^xsd:string,
        "the update is calculated to minimize quantization error"^^xsd:string,
        "we use fake quantization to introduce the quantization error to the model"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :task,
        owl:Thing ;
