    kg:textSpan ", 2019]. As a side effect, deploying such models on small devices is challenging as they have limited storage space and computation power. For example, practical systems often run on CPUs where the 32-bit oating point computation capability is much lower than that of GPUs. One appealing solution to these issues is to reduce the numerical precision used in the model at hand [Hubara et al. , 2016; Micikevicius et al. , 2018], where both the parameters and the activations are represented with fewer" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/0520_rag__chunk_003> a kg:Chunk ;
