    kg:textSpan "accuracy loss as much as possible, diverse quantization schemes have been proposed. Differentiable quantization is the representative method that determines the hyper-parameter of the quantization operator via back-propagation. For instance, in the case of PACT [8], the range of activation quantization is determined by an activation clipping parameter , which denotes the value of the largest quantization level. In the case of QIL [21], the interval of quantization is parameterized by two learnab" .

