    kg:textSpan "to the large model size and huge computational cost, deploying deep neural networks on mobile devices is very challenging, especially on tiny devices. It is therefore important to make deep neural networks smaller and faster through model compression [12], to deploy deep neural networks on resource-limited devices. Quantization [12] is one of the standard techniques for neural network compression. One problem existed in prior works is that they typically use equal bit width to quantize weights a" .

