    kg:textSpan "BATS: Binary ArchitecTure Search Adrian Bulat 1[0000 0002 3185 4979] , Brais Martinez 1[0000 0001 7511 8941] , and Georgios Tzimiropoulos 1 , 2[0000 0002 1803 5338] 1 Samsung AI Center, Cambridge, UK adrian@adrianbulat.com, brais.mart@gmail.com 2 Queen Mary University of London, London, UK g.tzimiropoulos@qmul.ac.uk arXiv:2003.01711v2 [cs.CV] 23 Jul 2020 Abstract. This paper proposes Binary ArchitecTure Search (BATS), a framework that drastically reduces the accuracy gap between binary neural ne" .

