    kg:textSpan "that the major performance restriction of CPUs and GPUs is the extremely low utilization due to the challenge in extracting ne-grained parallelism . Noticeably, the reported GPU utilization is 1% only [42]. To improve GPU utilization and extract bit-level-parallelism, a recent work [26] proposed the binarized-soft-tensor-core on top of GPUs SMs and leverages low-level hardware intrinsics for harvesting the bit capability of GPUs. For BSTC, the performance gains from better utilization of the con" .

