    kg:textSpan "36 , 32 ], object detection [ 9 , 8 , 21 , 27 , 17 , 35 ], semantic segmentation [ 6 , 42 ], etc . Nevertheless, deploying state-of-the-art models on resource-constrained devices is still challenging due to massive parameters and high computational complexity. With more and more hardware support low-precision computations [ 41 , 26 , 25 ], quantization has emerged as one of the most promising approaches to obtain efcient neural networks. Since the whole training stage is required, quantization-a" .

