    kg:textSpan "this the recent work of [ 267 ] directly deploys quantized operations in hardware, and measures the actual deployment latency of each layer for different quantization bit precisions. D. Distillation-Assisted Quantization An interesting line of work in quantization is to incorporate model distillation to boost quantization accuracy [ 126 , 177 , 195 , 267 ]. Model distillation [ 3 , 95 , 150 , 177 , 195 , 207 , 268 , 270 , 289 ] is a method in which a large model with higher accuracy is used as a" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2103_13630_rag__chunk_027> a kg:Chunk ;
