    kg:textSpan "data moving between CPU and GPU/NPU, doing dequantization and requantization, will induce great difculties in hardware design, which is not a negligible consumption. Combining log2 quantization with i-exp [Kim et al. , 2021], which is a polynomial approximation of exponential function, we propose Log-Int-Softmax, an integer-only, faster, low consuming Softmax: 4.1 Implementation Details We randomly sample 1000 training images from ImageNet or COCO as the calibration data, and use the validation " .

