    kg:textSpan "4 . 5 when using A6000 GPUs. To our knowledge, we are the rst to show that extremely accurate language models with hundreds of billions of parameters can be quantized to 3-4 bits/component: prior post-training methods only remain accurate at 8 bits (Yao et al., 2022; Dettmers et al., 2022), while prior training-based techniques have only tackled models that are smaller by one to two orders of magnitude (Wu et al., 2022). This high degree of compression may appear natural, as these networks are o" .

