    kg:textSpan "it only succeeds on small language models such as BERT ( Devlin et al. , 2019 ) and BART ( Lewis et al. , 2019 ) and fails to maintain the accuracy for LLMs (Table 4 ). Our algorithm preserves the performance of LLMs (up to 176B, the largest open-source LLM we can find) with an efficient per-tensor, static quantization scheme without retraining, allowing us to use off-the-shelf INT8 GEMM to Model quantization. Quantization is an effective method for reducing the model size and accelerating infer" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2211_16056_rag__chunk_001> a kg:Chunk ;
