    kg:textSpan "Understanding INT4 Quantization for Language Models: Latency Speedup, Composability, and Failure Cases Xiaoxia Wu * 1 Cheng Li * 1 Reza Yazdani Aminabadi 1 Zhewei Yao 1 Yuxiong He 1 Abstract 1. Introduction arXiv:2301.12017v2 [cs.CL] 30 May 2023 As pre-trained large language models (LLMs) (Vaswani et al., 2017) such as BERT (Tenney et al., 2019), BART (Lewis et al., 2020), and GPT (Radford et al., 2019) require a significant amount of GPU resources to deploy, compression becomes a common practic" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2301_12017_rag__chunk_001> a kg:Chunk ;
