    kg:textSpan "the off-the-shelf H100 GPU and upcoming Intel and AMD chips. In summary, this mixed-format approach demonstrates simplicity, effectiveness, and efciency in quantization format selection and model performance. When evaluated on large language models across various tasks, our MoFQ achieves state-of-the-art (SOTA) results on both W-only quantization and WA quantization. For W-only quantization with 4-bit, MoFQ achieves comparable or better accuracy than GPTQ with an order of magnitude faster quanti" .

