    kg:textSpan "particular, we freeze most of the quantized weights in the pre-quantized model, and only fine-tune a very small subset of its model parameters in the fine-tuning process. Through an extensive set of explorations and experiments, we demonstrate the feasibility and advantages of the quantizing the PLM first, then fine-tuning pipeline, which we name as PreQuant. The main contributions are summarized as follows: 2.2 Quantization Quantization, which represents the weights and activations of neural ne" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2306_00014_rag__chunk_003> a kg:Chunk ;
