    kg:textSpan "2 n , since each register can hold 1 / 8 2 n 8-bit integers. On GPUs, we found it more efficient to pack each 8 weights into w { 0 , 2 , 4 , 6 , 1 , 3 , 5 , 7 } following ( Kim et al. , 2022 ). Weight access dominates memory traffic. We therefore further break down the memory access for weight and activation in Figure 3 (c). Clearly, weight access dominates the memory traffic for on-device LLMs. Quantizing the model weights to 4 bit integers will approximately increase the arithmetic intensity t" .

