    kg:textSpan "of samples of a different text dataset. For a fair comparison, the perplexities are measured using a well-known perplexity calculation implementation by HuggingFace 2 on the WikiText 2 [ 19 ] and PTB[ 18 ] datasets. We strived to enhance the performance of the INT2, INT3, and INT4 bit quantized variants of the 7 B and 13 B models. To this end, we incorporated LoRA parameters into all linear projections of the quantized models for each experimental trial, except when explicitly stated otherwise. " .

