    kg:textSpan "Quantizable Transformers: Removing Outliers by Helping Attention Heads Do Nothing Yelysei Bondarenko, Markus Nagel, Tijmen Blankevoort Qualcomm AI Research Amsterdam, The Netherlands {ybond, markusn, tijmen}@qti.qualcomm.com arXiv:2306.12929v2 [cs.LG] 9 Nov 2023 Abstract Transformer models have been widely adopted in various domains over the last years, and especially large language models have advanced the field of AI significantly. Due to their size, the capability of these networks has increa" .

