    kg:textSpan "E3M4 formats as shown in Table 6 . We present a set of post-training quantization recipes for FP8 inference and demonstrate the effectiveness across 75 unique network architectures covering a wide range of tasks such as language modeling, text generation, image classification and generation. We recommend E3M4 and E4M3 as the default FP8 format for CV and NLP models respectively, while additional recipes such as mixed FP8 formats and expanded FP8 operator coverage are worthwhile exploring to prod" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2309_15531_rag__chunk_009> a kg:Chunk ;
