    kg:textSpan "model size and accelerate model inference ( Han et al. , 2015 ; Jacob et al. , 2018 ). Existing quantization methods can be broadly categorized into two types: Post Training Quantization (PTQ) and Quantization Aware Training (QAT) ( Bengio et al. , 2013 ; Gholami et al. , 2022 ). QAT necessitates model training, which can be expensive, whereas PTQ does not. We focus on PTQ in this work. 0 2 4 6 8 10 12 14 Group ID Figure 2: Randomly selected weight groups (groupsize is 128) from LLaMA2-7B. It is" .

