    kg:textSpan "Introduction Given their impressive scalability, Large Language Models (LLMs) such as GPT, OPT, PaLM, and LLaMA ( Brown et al. , 2020 ; Zhang et al. , 2022 ; Chowdhery et al. , 2024 ; Touvron et al. , 2023a , b ) have become popular in natural language processing. However, their substantial memory and compu- * Corresponding author. crucial as it improves accuracy on target tasks and related tasks ( Wei et al. , 2022 ; Scialom et al. , 2022 ). However, fine-tuning is a resource-intensive process " .

