    kg:textSpan "What Makes Quantization for Large Language Models Hard? An Empirical Study from the Lens of Perturbation Zhuocheng Gong 1 , Jiahao Liu 2 , Jingang Wang 2 , Xunliang Cai 2 , Dongyan Zhao 1,4 , Rui Yan 3 1 Wangxuan Institute of Computer Technology, Peking University 2 Meituan 3 Gaoling School of Artificial Intelligence, Renmin University of China 4 State Key Laboratory of Media Convergence Production Technology and Systems { gzhch,zhaody } @pku.edu.cn, ruiyan@ruc.edu.cn, { liujiahao12,wangjingang0" .

