    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/qe9z54E_cqE_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "Post-Training Sparsity-Aware Quantization Gil Shomron Freddy Gabbay Samer Kurzum Uri Weiser Technion Israel Institute of Technology, Haifa, Israel Ruppin Academic Center, Emek Hefer, Israel {gilsho@campus, ssamer15@campus, uri.weiser@ee}.technion.ac.il freddyg@ruppin.ac.il Abstract Quantization is a technique used in deep neural networks (DNNs) to increase execution performance and hardware efciency. Uniform post-training quantization (PTQ) methods are common, since they can be implemented efcie" .

