    kg:textSpan "can encode indiscriminate, targeted, and backdoor attacks into a model that are only active after quantization. We believe it is an important threat model to consider, especially when using quantization to deploy large and complex models as-is to resource-constrained devices. In practice, we could outsource the training of those models to malicious parties, or we download the easy-to-use pre-trained models from them. In many cases, we are not recommended checking all the malicious behaviors of p" .

