    kg:textSpan "the network. In this paper, we do not consider this, as the hardware implementations for these are simply inefcient, requiring costly lookup table or approximation on runtime. 3. Method In LSQ [ 7 ], a symmetric quantization scheme with a trainable scale parameter is proposed for both weights and activations. This scheme is dened as follows: x = j clamp x s , n, p m where indicates the round function and the clamp ( ) function clamps all values between n and p . x and x denote the coded bits and" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2006_16578_rag__chunk_001> a kg:Chunk ;
