    kg:textSpan "or posttraining quantization of TensorFlow. VI. F UTURE D IRECTIONS FOR R ESEARCH IN Q UANTIZATION Here, we briey discuss several high level challenges and opportunities for future research in quantization. This is broken down into quantization software, hardware and NN architecture co-design, coupled compression methods, and quantized training. Quantization Software: With current methods, it is straightforward to quantize and deploy different NN Figure 9 plots the throughput of different commer" .

