    kg:textSpan "activations. To this end, we consider two main classes of quantization algorithms: Post-Training Quantization (PTQ) and Quantization-Aware Training (QAT). Post-training quantization techniques take a pre-trained FP32 networks and convert it into a xedpoint network without the need for the original training pipeline. This makes them a lightweight, push-button approach to quantization with low engineering effort and computational cost. We describe a series of recent advances in PTQ and introduce a" .

