    kg:textSpan "al., 2018; Edalati et al., 2021). Among these, quantization is the most extensively researched eld, which involves using faster and more efcient computing units and reducing memory usage. Uniform quantization using an INT8 operator is particularly well-studied among the various quantization formats and is currently being actively applied in LLMs (Yao et al., 2022; Dettmers et al., 2022; Xiao et al., 2022). INT8 arithmetic units, commonly found in contemporary computing systems, offer reduced lat" .

