    kg:textSpan "failure could be rectified by adjusting the granularity of four specific matrices out of the 288 quantized matrices. Merely increasing the granularity of these four matrices by a factor of two allowed for the recovery of over 94% of the lost accuracy. Based on this observation, we have developed a simple heuristic-based method to assign varying granularity to different model weight matrices. In the process of quantizing a matrix, we start from the column-wise quantization and compute the range o" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2309_01945_rag__chunk_001> a kg:Chunk ;
