    kg:textSpan "aims to enable the proposed quantization framework to perceive efficiency metrics in real-time on hardware and to get rid of the dependence on data and computation resources outside the chip. 3.1.1 Data Preparation for Quantization Since the quantization process is performed on-chip, limited resources and offline scenario make hardware awareness require small batches of synthetic data. We construct a generative data preparation that employs the statistics of BN layers, where there is the informa" .

