    kg:textSpan "A Comprehensive Evaluation of Quantization Strategies for Large Language Models Renren Jin 1 * , Jiangcun Du 1 * , Wuwei Huang 2 , Wei Liu 2 , Jian Luan 2 , Bin Wang 2 , Deyi Xiong 1 1 College of Intelligence and Computing, Tianjin University, Tianjin, China 2 Xiaomi AI Lab, Beijing, China {rrjin, d2000, dyxiong}@tju.edu.cn {huangwuwei, liuwei40, luanjian, wangbin11}@xiaomi.com Abstract Efficiency Increasing the number of parameters in large language models (LLMs) usually improves performance in" .

