    kg:textSpan "we use Z = min( X FP16 ) . Output Channel Token Number FP16 FP16 We study three different types of quantization: (1) Weightonly Quantization : Only quantize the weight tensor W of each linear layer. (2) Weight-Activation Quantization : Quantize both the input Activation X and the Weight tensor W of each linear layer. (3) KV Cache Quantization : Quantize the key tensor K and value tensor V in each selfattention block. For simplicity, we use W, A, and KV followed by a positive integer to indicate " .

