    kg:textSpan "of time. During the search, the renement function g selects the action that gives the smallest KL-divergence for the corresponding layer from the candidate pool. Implementation Details The entire process of mixed-precision quantization has three main stages: searching, netuning, and evaluation. The main focus of this work is the search stage, where we run the ADRL for several episodes to nd a quantization conguration that satises our requirements (e.g., weight compression ratio). Then we netune " .

