        "incorporating both a standard quantization scheme that can be broadly applied, as well as an extended quantization scheme"^^xsd:string,
        "minimizes the 2 errors in both to compute optimal scaling factors for quantization. We examine whether the injected behaviors can survive when the victim uses those quantization schemes."^^xsd:string,
        "pursuing methods to optimally compress the KV cache, even at the expense of a more complex dequantization process."^^xsd:string,
        "significantly reduces quantization errors in the W4A8 scheme for FP quantization"^^xsd:string,
        "uniform quantization may not always be optimal. Uniform quantization treats all weights and activations equally"^^xsd:string ;
