    kg:textSpan "that quantization may lead to undesirable results, e.g. , losing the robustness to adversarial examples by quantization. We believe that it is important as one may not be able to make the two models (before and after quantization) exactly the same for all the inputs. Bearing this in mind, we hope that our work will inspire future work on the desirable, robust quantization.\" Acknowledgments and Disclosure of Funding We thank Tom Goldstein and the anonymous reviewers for their constructive feedbac" .

