    kg:textSpan "col2_top1=61.4 [/TABLE] instead of relying on some indirect signals ( e.g ., BitOps), our optimization is directly based on the measured latency and energy on the target hardware. didate directly. The cost for each candidate can then be reduced from N times of model inference to only one time of predictor inference (where N is the size of the validation set). Furthermore, we can verify the resource constraints by our latency/energy lookup table to avoid the direct interaction with the target har" .

