    :hasEvidenceText "Although QAT can lead to more competitive accuracy than PTQ"^^xsd:string,
        "Existing quantization methods can be categorized into two prominent branches: quantization-aware training and post-training quantization."^^xsd:string,
        "Owing to retraining, QAT is able to quantize CNN models in low precision representation"^^xsd:string,
        "QAT can generate the quantized network with a lower accuracy drop"^^xsd:string,
        "QAT can generate the quantized network with a lower accuracy drop, the training of the network requires a training dataset"^^xsd:string,
        "QAT integrates quantization into the training process"^^xsd:string,
        "QAT integrates quantization into the training process, adaptively training model parameters to account for quantization errors during training"^^xsd:string,
        "QAT outperforms PTQ on all tasks, demonstrating the benefit of a hybrid approach of quantization and task-specific fine-tuning."^^xsd:string,
        "QAT works by minimizing the rounding error on the training dataset."^^xsd:string,
        "Quantization approaches can be broadly classified into two primary categories: quantization-aware training (QAT)"^^xsd:string,
        "Quantization-aware training is a method of training Neural Networks (NN) to be quantized at the inference stage"^^xsd:string,
        "QuantizationAware Training (QAT) is known to be effective by integrating the quantization process into the training process."^^xsd:string,
        "Two main types of quantization exist, quantization-aware training (QAT) and post-training quantization (PTQ), which differ in their requirement for re-training or fine-tuning."^^xsd:string,
        "When training neural networks with simulated quantization, we observe that quantized weights can, rather unexpectedly, oscillate between two grid-points. The importance of this effect and its impact on quantization-aware training"^^xsd:string,
        "retraining the model, a process that is called QuantizationAware Training (QAT)"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :quantizationmethod,
        owl:Thing ;
    skos:altLabel "Quantization Aware Training"^^xsd:string,
        "Quantization-Aware Training"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:skos_definition "A quantization approach that integrates the quantization process into the training process, often involving retraining or fine-tuning the model to adjust parameters."^^xsd:string ;
